#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "1. Purpose of the Application"
msgstr "1. Purpose of the Application"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "{NAME_APP} is a comprehensive mobile and web application designed to help beauty professionals (stylists, makeup artists, nail technicians, and other beauty specialists) manage their business operations effectively. The application allows users to create detailed client profiles, manage appointments, synchronize schedules with device calendars, send SMS reminders to clients, convert voice notes to text for appointment documentation, store photos from appointments, and receive notifications about upcoming appointments."
msgstr "{NAME_APP} is a comprehensive mobile and web application designed to help beauty professionals (stylists, makeup artists, nail technicians, and other beauty specialists) manage their business operations effectively. The application allows users to create detailed client profiles, manage appointments, synchronize schedules with device calendars, send SMS reminders to clients, convert voice notes to text for appointment documentation, store photos from appointments, and receive notifications about upcoming appointments."

